            <name>
                <baseName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ground heat exchanger for office buildings, short: 0.667 m</baseName>
            </name>
            <classificationInformation>
                <common:classification>
                    <common:class level="0" classId="791c965a-a367-3765-af5c-749f3b9a1d40">waste management</common:class>
                    <common:class level="1" classId="593ec29a-698c-369e-be95-7d8b4d0d7ef7">building demolition</common:class>
                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Disposal of a ground heat exchanger for an office building with a specific air flow rate of 0.92 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. The reference value of the inventory is 1 m2 heated gross floor area. The inventory is based on a study of an appartment building with 6 flats, a heated gross floor area of The inventory is based on a long ground heat exchanger with a specific duct lenght of 0.167m per m3 nominal air flow.  m3/h. The inventory includes a ground heat exchanger with 200mm diameter and a lenght of 0.667m/m2. The data represents a ground heat exchanger made of polyethylene. It includes the excavating needed and a bedding layer made of poor concrete.;
UUID: 358940bd-a0bd-4077-86b7-4b4a50915d47</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
