            </locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction>
        </geography>
        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes are landfilled.\n\n# Included processes\nTransport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
